~ knife
set GlobalState.player_can_move = false
There's a {{item_name}} on the table. Pick it up?
- Pick up
	set GlobalState.mark_item_collected(item_name)
	set GlobalState.set_room_state("LevelBedroom", "blackout", true)
	Picked up {{item_name}}!
- Leave
set GlobalState.player_can_move = true
=> END